          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "MATHEMATICS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.341,
            0.141,
            0.471,
            0.226
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_1_equation_2.jpg",
          "content": "\\overline{x} = \\frac{\\displaystyle \\sum_{i = 1}^{n} f_{i} x_{i}}{\\displaystyle \\sum_{i = 1}^{n} f_{i}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.227,
            0.901,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "which, more briefly, is written as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\int \\overline { { x } }   = \\frac { \\sum f _ { i } x _ { i } } { \\sum f _ { i } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , if it is understood that i varies from 1 to n."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.287,
            0.742,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us apply this formula to find the mean in the following example."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.318,
            0.902,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 1 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The marks obtained by 30 students of Class X of a certain school in a Mathematics paper consisting of 100 marks are presented in table below. Find the mean of the marks obtained by the students."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.381,
            0.898,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.101,
                0.381,
                0.898,
                0.489
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_table_6.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Marks obtained (x<sub>i</sub>)</td><td>10</td><td>20</td><td>36</td><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>56</td><td>60</td><td>70</td><td>72</td><td>80</td><td>88</td><td>92</td><td>95</td></tr><tr><td>Number of students (f<sub>i</sub>)</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.501,
            0.9,
            0.542
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Recall that to find the mean marks, we require the product of each "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " with the corresponding frequency f. So, let us put them in a column as shown in Table 13.1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
